# UI-WINDOW-1 fix round R2 (R2-2): the status bar's materials and residents follow the island the
# view is centred on (the owner's rule; docs/re/ui.md 5.2, OQ-622). Centred on the developer
# island (tile 1140 516, the lan5 island at 1048 440 with the local player's city): shown, also on
# the player list. Over open sea (700 700) and over an island without the player's city (lan5's
# island at 864 168, centre 928 232): hidden. The `hud.counters` fact is what the last frame drew.
# Launch: --play data/maps/lan5.txt --construction-menu on --layout data/ui
resize 1024 768
wait frames 5
look 1140 516
wait frames 5
expect fact hud.counters == shown
screenshot counters_island
lookw 700 700
wait frames 5
expect fact hud.counters == hidden
screenshot counters_sea
lookw 928 232
wait frames 5
expect fact hud.counters == hidden
look 1140 516
wait frames 5
expect fact hud.counters == shown
click_px 870 212
wait frames 3
expect fact ui.tab == player_list
expect fact hud.counters == shown
quit
